  "_doc": "The three playable kids Helena (12), Kilian (10) and Lorenz (8) (CAP-12, spec family-characters.md). Attributes are 0..10 (growth in data/attr-growth.json); `modifiers` turns attributes into gameplay numbers per point around `pivot`; `perks` are numeric strengths read by their systems (aimPrecision: slingshot spread cut, bullyTargetWeight: how much more bullies prefer this kid, trickMultiplier: Style payout, stickThrowRange: stick tool range, forgetHomeworkChance: school chore roll, busGrabBonus, talkDownBonus, musicArtBonus: additive shares (0.3 = +30%) on the grab-target window, the bully talk-down roll and the music/art minigame score, kiaiPower: multiplier on the Kiai radius and the Aerger a Kiai takes off, see defense/beltCore.js). Per character: `startBelt` (optional, the karate belt a new game starts with, state action player.setCharacter), `learningStartOffset` (added to the learning start level of topics the kid has not answered yet, learning/engineCore.js), `spriteScale` (1 = normal, the younger kid is a bit smaller). A start vehicle without a profile in data/vehicles.json or outside `playerVehicles` falls back to foot. `palette` (outfit colours) and `look` (hairStyle: short|shoulder|wild, glasses, eyes = eye colour, freckles) feed the shared player art in scenes/CharacterArt.js.",
